WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.715
Export your browser history

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.360
as CSV, JSON, or HTML.

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.635
With HistoryOut, turn your visits

4
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.855
into a useful file

5
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.240
you can open or share.

6
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.410
Choose your own dates and columns,

7
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.955
then search or filter

8
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.460
to keep the pages you need.

9
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.015
Remove repeat visits

10
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.340
and URL parameters before exporting.

11
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.555
Daily recaps and saved views

12
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.720
help tomorrow, too.

13
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.920
HistoryOut is free and local,

14
00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.040
with no account.
